      "a": "Oklahoma received $4.1B in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Obligations fell 39.3% year over year. The state recorded 17,968 awards with an average award size of $230K. FY25 obligations were $6.8B and FY24 obligations were $5.5B."
    },
